## Time Complexity - O(V+E)
O(V) - distance array
O(K) - adding k no of sources
O(V+E) - BFS travesal adding in queue

## Space complexity-
counting only the algorithm's extra (auxiliary) space:
Queue → O(V)
Distance array → O(V)

Total: O(V)
If counting the graph storage as well:
Adjacency List : O(V + E)
Distance Array : O(V)
Queue          : O(V)

Total = O(V + E)
